{"type":"run_completed","text":"I’m a hands‑on Roblox Studio assistant that can work directly inside your place. Here’s what I can do for you:\n\n- **Create and modify objects** – I can add new Parts, Models, GUI elements, Scripts, ModuleScripts, RemoteEvents, etc., and I can rename, move, or delete any existing instance you point to.  \n- **Write and edit scripts** – I can replace the full source of a Script, LocalScript, or ModuleScript, or patch a specific snippet inside an existing script. I never ask you to paste anything; I just apply the change for you.  \n- **Control properties** – I can set any property on any instance (size, color, CFrame, etc.) or batch‑set many at once.  \n- **Set up server‑client communication** – I can place RemoteEvents, RemoteFunctions, RemoteCommands, and write the corresponding server‑ and client‑side code to handle them.  \n- **Work with DataStores** – I can read, write, increment, or delete keys in your game’s DataStore, handling the required approvals and summarising the changes.  \n- **Add assets from the Toolbox** – I can search the catalog, let you pick an asset, and insert it while optionally stripping out any embedded scripts.  \n- **Run and control playtests** – I can start or stop a Play Solo/team test session, capture logs, and help you iterate on bugs.  \n- **Debug and analyse problems** – I can surface Script Analyzer errors, surface the call stack, and suggest fixes for logic or runtime issues.  \n- **Coordinate complex tasks** – I’m able to plan a multi‑step feature (e.g., a shop, a leaderboard, a custom ability) and execute each step in the correct order, making sure each piece is created, wired up, and verified.  \n\nAll of that is done by calling the internal Studio tools directly, so you don’t have to leave the editor or manually copy‑paste anything. If you have a specific project or feature in mind, just let me know and I’ll start working on it right away.","iterations":1,"sequence":73,"conversationId":"7fd2ab6a-b407-42f9-b9b4-435642958adb","runId":"e623524a-9677-465e-bdb4-40713036302f","timestamp":"2026-05-31T10:10:24.090Z"}
